WEBVTT

00:00:03.217 --> 00:00:05.891
The designer saves the draft as you work.

00:00:05.891 --> 00:00:09.534
The Issues tab lists what must be fixed before publishing.

00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:13.347
Publish creates the first version, which is the one runs use.

00:00:13.807 --> 00:00:15.865
Run starts the published version.

00:00:15.865 --> 00:00:19.770
The run is queued and executes in the background, with the access of

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:21.987
the user who published the pipeline.

00:00:22.446 --> 00:00:24.682
The History tab lists the runs.

00:00:24.682 --> 00:00:29.035
With a run selected, each step on the canvas shows its status, and

00:00:29.035 --> 00:00:31.756
the number of rows or files it handled.

00:00:32.215 --> 00:00:34.291
Open the run shows its page:

00:00:34.291 --> 00:00:38.262
each step with its status and its rows in and out, what the

00:00:38.262 --> 00:00:40.277
run delivered, and its log.

00:00:40.277 --> 00:00:43.515
Here, it saved a CSV file to the media library.

00:00:43.966 --> 00:00:48.777
The Run History page lists the runs, the most recent first, with their

00:00:48.777 --> 00:00:52.195
status, version, duration, and who started them.

00:00:52.195 --> 00:00:55.106
A link shows the runs of every pipeline.

00:00:55.563 --> 00:01:00.860
On the Pipelines page, the pipeline shows its version and the status of its last run.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:05.283
Its Actions menu can run it again, open its Run history, or delete it.

